ent": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le17ob03re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le17ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le17ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "\u201cLook in the sky! It's a bird! It's a plane! It's Superman!\u201d No, it's a kite!\nTons of kites are soaring the cool October skies of Brisbane, Australia, which is celebrating the end of summer with a kiteflying festival. There are some fierce dragons from China, a few spaceships from Cape Canaveral, and even a couple of Mickey Mouse kites."}, {"time": "21500", "image": "engenn6le17ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "The prizes, however, will go to the homemade kites. There is a prize for the most beautiful kite, the highest flying kite, the largest kite, the most original kite, and even the ugliest kite! The judges will have to decide which kites are better, more sophisticated and more stunning!"}, {"time": "38500", "image": "engenn6le17ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "Even if you're just learning the ropes in kiteflying, going to some festivals might be the best way to connect to other kite-flyers and to see the most incredible kites from around the world. Your own kite flying skills may improve just by watching some of the best in these competitions or demonstrations."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn6le17ob03re6aud01"}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 2, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Leisure Time"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Kite Culture"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le17ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Quantifiers"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use a quantifier before a noun to indicate the amount or number of an item. Quantifiers do not indicate a specific quantity but rather a general amount."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul>  \t<li>You use quantifiers with both count and non-count nouns.</li> \t<li>Quantifiers like a few, <span class=\"italic\">several, many</span>, <span class=\"italic\">dozens</span>, <span class=\"italic\">hundreds</span>, <span class=\"italic\">thousands</span>, or <span class=\"italic\">millions</span>, can only be used with count nouns. </li> \t<li>You can use all of the quantifiers below with both count and non-count nouns.</li> </ul>   \t\t\t"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Quantifier \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a couple<br /> a few<br /> no/none<br /> any /not any<br /> some<br /> a lot of / lots of  / tons<br /> plenty of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"two<br /> around three or more<br /> 0, nothing<br /> to ask about / say there is not<br /> a small, general number or amount<br /> a very large number or amount<br /><br /> more than you need\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "There are <span class=\"strong\">some</span> fierce dragons from China, <span class=\"strong\">a few</span> spaceships from Cape Canaveral, and even <span class=\"strong\">a couple</span> of Mickey Mouse kites."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you talk about a kiteflying competition."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Comparatives/Superlatives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use comparative adjectives to compare yourself to another      person.<br />    You use a superlative adjective to compare yourself or          something to a group of people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can compare things using the words <span class=\"italic\">more (than)</span> or <span class=\"italic\">less (than)</span>.      You can also use adjectives to compare things. Some adjectives        change to different words in the comparative and superlative form.     With one syllable words, you add <span class =\"strong\">-er </span>to the adjective to make the       comparative form. You add <span class =\"strong\">-est</span> to the adjective to make the         superlative form. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "With words of two or more syllables, you add the word more before          the adjective or adverb in the comparative form. You add the most      before the adjective or the adverb in the superlative form.    "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The adjective highflying is one word, but it is separated into two          words in the comparative and superlative forms."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective<br /> or<br />  Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Superlative\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" more\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the most\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"less\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the least\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" highflying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" higher flying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the highest flying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"large\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"larger\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the largest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ugly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"uglier \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the ugliest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"beautiful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more beautiful \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most beautiful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sophisticated\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more sophisticated\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most sophisticated\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stunning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more stunning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the most stunning\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "There is a prize for the most beautiful kite, the highest flying kite, the largest kite, the most original kite, and even the ugliest kite! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The judges will have to decide which kites are better, more sophisticated and more stunning!"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to celebrate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do something special for a particular happy reason"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Brisbane, Australia is celebrating the end of summer with a kiteflying festival. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "homemade"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "fabricated by hand"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He made his own kite. It's a beautiful homemade kite."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ugly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not attractive"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This kite is very beautiful, but that one is very ugly. It is the ugliest."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "judge"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the person who chooses the winner of a competition"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The judges will have to decide which kites are better, more sophisticated and more stunning."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob03aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " demonstration"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an event organized to show something to the public"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your kite flying skills may improve by watching these competitions or demonstrations.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob03aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dragon"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a mythical creature that breathes fire"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Some kites are shaped like dragons."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob03aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "spaceship"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a vehicle used to travel in space "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Other kites look like spaceships."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le17ob03aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Draw or find 6 images of kites on the Internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give a prize to each kite. Write a sentence using the superlative structure, like <span class=\"italic\">This kite is the ugliest</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a sentence explaining why this kite won the prize."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your kites to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I draw or find 6 images of kites."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write sentences about the kites."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present the kite prizes."}]}]}